  "description": "TerraPDF is a free, open-source (MIT) C# PDF library for .NET. Generate PDF\n      documents such as invoices, reports, receipts, labels, certificates, and\n      statements from code with a fluent, composable API. Lightweight, zero-dependency,\n      and pure managed C#: no native binaries and no HTML-to-PDF browser engine.\n      Features include rich text styling, multi-span formatting, Column / Row / Table\n      layouts, PNG and JPEG images, borders, page breaks, hyperlinks, headers, footers,\n      page numbers, AES-256 encryption, Code128 barcodes, QR codes, custom TrueType\n      font embedding with automatic subsetting, vector graphics with rotated text\n      labels, elliptical arcs and pie sectors, dashed strokes, linear and radial\n      gradient fills, canvas links, bookmarks, and QR codes, positioned images with\n      five fit modes, and constant-alpha transparency, full Unicode support, and\n      cross-platform .NET 8, 9, and 10 support.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
