  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.4.0 is a performance release: documents render 2–30× faster with 60–95% fewer allocations. Wrapped text, tables, PNG images, custom fonts, QR codes, vector canvases and encrypted output are all faster; a logo reused across documents is converted once per process, and RGB and palette PNGs are embedded without decoding. Built-in font widths now match the Adobe AFM metrics (25 entries were wrong), so text containing those characters may wrap differently. Full changelog: https://github.com/sahebansari/TerraPDF/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
